  "description": "A lightweight .NET library for reading and writing Excel files (.xls / .xlsx) with minimal boilerplate. Map Excel columns to C# models using reflection and fuzzy header matching — no XML config or attributes required. Supports multi-sheet workbooks, custom column mappings, property exclusions, and configurable column widths.",
